# under the SuperAnimal-Quadruped schema (antler/mouth-corner/belly/body-
# middle/tail-tip points a mouse doesn't have distinct anatomy for).
# Originally excluded from the 3D pipeline's triangulation/H5 output/overlays
# (cube_3d_dlc.py); confirmed on an independent 2D rig too, so directly
# applicable here: the Two-Camera fusion plan's skeleton/bodypart selection
# should skip these rather than spend homography/bone-constraint effort on
